{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MOD = 1000000007;\nconst int LIM = 1000010;\n\nint parentArr[LIM], rankArr[LIM];\n\nint findRootIter(int x) {\n    int root = x;\n    while (parentArr[root] != root)\n        root = parentArr[root];\n\n    while (parentArr[x] != x) {\n        int nxt = parentArr[x];\n        parentArr[x] = root;\n        x = nxt;\n    }\n    return root;\n}\n\nvoid unionRoots(int a, int b) {\n    if (rankArr[a] >= rankArr[b]) {\n        parentArr[b] = a;\n        ++rankArr[a];\n    } else {\n        parentArr[a] = b;\n        ++rankArr[b];\n    }\n}\n\nlong long fastPow(long long a, long long b) {\n    long long ans = 1;\n    while (b) {\n        if (b & 1LL)\n            ans = (ans * a) % MOD;\n        a = (a * a) % MOD;\n        b >>= 1LL;\n    }\n    return ans;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int P, K;\n    scanf(\"%d%d\", &P, &K);\n\n    memset(rankArr, 0, sizeof(rankArr));\n    for (int i = 1; i < P; ++i) {\n        parentArr[i] = i;\n        rankArr[i] = 1;\n    }\n    parentArr[0] = 0;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < P; ++i) {\n        int to = (int)((long long)K * i % P);\n        int a = findRootIter(i);\n        int b = findRootIter(to);\n        if (a != b)\n            unionRoots(a, b);\n    }\n\n    set<int> groups;\n    for (int i = 1; i < P; ++i)\n        groups.insert(findRootIter(i));\n\n    long long ways;\n    if (!K)\n        ways = fastPow(P, P - 1);\n    else if (K == 1)\n        ways = fastPow(P, P);\n    else\n        ways = fastPow(P, (long long)groups.size());\n\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", (int)ways);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MOD = 1000000007;\n    static final int LIM = 1000010;\n    static int[] parentArr = new int[LIM];\n    static int[] rankArr = new int[LIM];\n\n    static int findRootIter(int x) {\n        int root = x;\n        while (parentArr[root] != root)\n            root = parentArr[root];\n\n        while (parentArr[x] != x) {\n            int nxt = parentArr[x];\n            parentArr[x] = root;\n            x = nxt;\n        }\n        return root;\n    }\n\n    static void unionRoots(int a, int b) {\n        if (rankArr[a] >= rankArr[b]) {\n            parentArr[b] = a;\n            ++rankArr[a];\n        } else {\n            parentArr[a] = b;\n            ++rankArr[b];\n        }\n    }\n\n    static long fastPow(long a, long b) {\n        long ans = 1;\n        while (b > 0) {\n            if ((b & 1L) == 1L)\n                ans = (ans * a) % MOD;\n            a = (a * a) % MOD;\n            b >>= 1L;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int P = sc.nextInt();\n        int K = sc.nextInt();\n\n        // Initialize arrays\n        for (int i = 0; i < LIM; i++) {\n            parentArr[i] = i;\n            rankArr[i] = 0;\n        }\n        // Set rank for 1..P-1 to 1 (as in original code)\n        for (int i = 1; i < P; i++) {\n            rankArr[i] = 1;\n        }\n        parentArr[0] = 0;\n\n        for (int i = 1; i < P; i++) {\n            int to = (int)((long)K * i % P);\n            int a = findRootIter(i);\n            int b = findRootIter(to);\n            if (a != b)\n                unionRoots(a, b);\n        }\n\n        Set<Integer> groups = new HashSet<>();\n        for (int i = 1; i < P; i++)\n            groups.add(findRootIter(i));\n\n        long ways;\n        if (K == 0)\n            ways = fastPow(P, P - 1);\n        else if (K == 1)\n            ways = fastPow(P, P);\n        else\n            ways = fastPow(P, (long)groups.size());\n\n        System.out.println((int)ways);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.397406908334233e-05, -0.0032433071173727512, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.4318398573086597e-05, -0.015675773844122887, -0.0005553610390052199, 0.0, -6.079655122448457e-06, -0.0031805664766579866, -3.671578815556131e-05, -0.004603264853358269, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.753696753643453e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00043072958942502737, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.753696753643453e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.6927575416048057e-05, -4.529942543740617e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.5762470960617065, -0.10020744800567627, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.50339189733495e-06, -4.768360213347478e-06, 0.0, -0.003178308717906475, -9.989239333663136e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.9802276912960224e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.023382406681776047, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.001958001870661974, -4.768370445162